# ECB Architecture

## Layer Responsibilities
- Boundary handles input/output mapping and validation only.
- Control orchestrates use cases and coordinates entities.
- Entity owns core domain rules and invariants.

## Dependency Direction
- Boundary may depend on Control interfaces.
- Control may depend on Entity.
- Entity must not depend on Boundary, Control framework details, or I/O.

## Layer Guardrails
- Do not place business rules in Boundary.
- Do not couple Entity to external framework concerns.
